Package: AQD
Title: Model Selection with the Approximate Quasi-Deviance
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sharon", "Lutz", email = "smlutz@hsph.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Adam", "Reeson", role = "aut"))
Description: Exhaustive variable selection using approximate quasi-deviance
    (AQD) criteria, which require only the mean-variance relationship of the
    outcome. For every subset of candidate covariates, the AQD criteria
    AQD(y), AQD(mu) and the higher-order AQD-opt3 are computed alongside a
    baseline AIC and, optionally, the exact-likelihood AIC. Supports Gaussian,
    Tweedie, Conway-Maxwell-Poisson, quasi-Poisson, negative binomial, gamma,
    inverse Gaussian, binomial and beta outcomes.
License: GPL-2
